  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human-centred recovery and Decent Work agenda reflected in the UN Sustainable Development Cooperation Frameworks and Decent Work Country Programmes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will develop a Decent Work Country Programme for 2025-27 under the supervision of and based on the needs and guidance of the constituents and in alignment with the Government plans and goals and the United Nations Sustainable Development Cooperation Framework outcomes. The DWCP will align with the Programme and Budget of the ILO for both bienniums, 24-25 and 26-27, and with the ILO Decent Work Agenda and regional plans.</narrative>
  </description>
